# Read by the trivy-operator (infra/trivy-operator/app/kustomization.yaml copies this file into its
# HelmRelease values), by .github/workflows/trivy.yml and by `just sec scan`. An entry belongs here
# only when the scanner cannot decide the finding, not when the finding is inconvenient.
#
# coredns builds its own module as a pseudo-version (v0.0.0-<date>-<commit>), which Trivy cannot
# compare against an advisory's fixed version, so every coredns advisory matches whatever runs.
# Each of these names a fix older than the installed 1.14.x, and k3s bundles the image.
